[0.045, "o", "\u001b[3;6H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m\u001b[40mWelcome to \u001b[31m\u001b[40mD**m the Roguelike\u001b[33m\u001b[40m!\u001b[5;6HYou are running DRL for the first time. I hope you will find this\u001b[6;6Hroguelike game as enjoyable as it was for me to write it.\u001b[8;6HThis game is in active development (again?), and as such please be\u001b[9;6Halways sure that you have the most recent version, for bugs are fixed,\u001b[10;6Hnew features appear, and the game becomes better at every iteration.\u001b[11;6HYou can find the lastest version on DRL website:\u001b[13;6H\u001b[34m\u001b[40mhttps://drl.chaosforge.org/\r\u001b[14d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[K\u001b[15;6H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m\u001b[40mAlso, if you enjoy this game, join the Discord and/or the forums:\u001b[17;6H\u001b[34m\u001b[40mhttp://discord.gg/jupiterhell\u001b[18;6H"]
[0.000, "o", "http://forum.chaosforge.org/\u001b[20;6H\u001b[33m\u001b[40mYou can also follow me on X (\u001b[34m\u001b[40m@chaosforge_org\u001b[33m\u001b[40m/\u001b[34m\u001b[40m@epyoncf\u001b[33m\u001b[40m).\u001b[22;6HPress <\u001b[37m\u001b[40mEnter\u001b[33m\u001b[40m> to continue...\u001b[H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
